  "body": "This waterfront property has it all – a north facing freehold 900sqm (more or less) waterfront estate with direct access to the Orewa Estuary and a 407sqm (approximately) modern residence designed for space, style and family living. With cinematic views, seamless indoor-outdoor flow and resort-style features - from a chef’s kitchen to tropical gardens and a spa, every day feels like a holiday here.\r\n\r\nThe home faces out towards the water and maximises every facet of the cinematic and ever-changing spectacle. There’s no need for a bach when living here, simply walk your paddleboard or kayak out the gate and be on the water in minutes. The Te Ara Tahuna/Orewa Estuary Path and Cycleway is also right out front for cruising into Orewa for coffee, cocktails or a swim at the beach. \r\n\r\nGenerous proportions and a well-considered floorplan ensure space for the whole family to relax and reset - whether together or independently. Excellent storage solutions are thoughtfully integrated throughout, ensuing both practicality and comfort. Stylish interiors showcase a relaxed coastal elegance where no expense has been spared in creating a high-quality living environment. \r\n\r\nViews dazzle upstairs in the voluminous kitchen, living and dining space, which hosts a crowd with ease, and glass stackers open out to the large deck. Family and guests can gather around the large waterfall island in the chef’s kitchen, which also has a scullery.  \r\n\r\nThe master retreat features a huge walk-in robe, luxury ensuite and custom skylight with retractable screen to enjoy the stars from bed. Two more bedrooms in the separate accommodation wing share a bathroom and each enjoy a walk-in robe.  \r\n\r\nThe ground floor incorporates a media room/lounge, large office and gym/games room, as well as a bedroom and bathroom – ideal for teens and guests. A spacious covered deck with outdoor fire and private spa pool area are enveloped with stunning tropical gardens. \r\n\r\nTriple garaging is carpeted and boasts a handy mezzanine storage space. An additional entrance provides level parking suitable for campervans or boats.",
